### 6.4 车辆车门控制下发接口
- MCP工具名：`car.door_control`
- 工具描述：下发车辆车门控制指令
- 输入参数：token、tokenIssuer、vin、cmdType、parameter（JSON）
- 返回：控制结果JSON
- 参考实现：
```cpp
mcp_server.AddTool("car.door_control", "车辆车门控制", PropertyList({
    Property("token", kPropertyTypeString),
    Property("tokenIssuer", kPropertyTypeString),
    Property("vin", kPropertyTypeString),
    Property("cmdType", kPropertyTypeInteger),
    Property("parameter", kPropertyTypeString)
}), [this](const PropertyList& properties) -> ReturnValue {
    std::string url = "https://gateway.wuzheng.com.cn/vehicle/control/bos/issue_terminal_control_command";
    cJSON* req = cJSON_CreateObject();
    cJSON_AddStringToObject(req, "vin", properties["vin"].value<std::string>().c_str());
    cJSON_AddStringToObject(req, "protocolType", "GB32960");
    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(req, "issueTime", (double)time(NULL) * 1000);
    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(req, "cmdType", properties["cmdType"].value<int>());
    cJSON* param = cJSON_Parse(properties["parameter"].value<std::string>().c_str());
    cJSON_AddItemToObject(req, "parameter", param);
    std::string body = cJSON_PrintUnformatted(req);
    cJSON_Delete(req);
    std::map<std::string, std::string> headers = {
        {"Authorization", properties["token"].value<std::string>()},
        {"X-Token-Issuer", properties["tokenIssuer"].value<std::string>()},
        {"X-Request-Id", "1"}
    };
    std::string response = HttpPost(url, body, headers);
    return response;
});
```

